    <sys:String x:Key="LOCMelcosoftWelcomeTitle">Welcome to Melcosoft Launcher</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCMelcosoftWelcomeIntro">Melcosoft Launcher is your gateway to the full Melcosoft game catalog. Browse, download, install, and play Melcosoft titles — all from one place. Your Steam library is connected automatically, so your Steam games appear here as well.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCMelcosoftWelcomeLanguageTip">You can change the launcher language at any time in Settings.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCMelcosoftWelcomeToolbarHeading">Top-right toolbar buttons:</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCMelcosoftWelcomeToolbarRegion">• Download Region — select the server region closest to you. This affects download speed and reliability.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCMelcosoftWelcomeToolbarSync">• Sync — synchronize the game catalog and file information with Melcosoft servers.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCMelcosoftWelcomeToolbarError">• Error Report — if something goes wrong, submit a report to the support team.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCMelcosoftWelcomeMultiLaunchTip">To open multiple windows of the same game at the same time, right-click the game and select "Launch another game instance".</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCMelcosoftWelcomeRegionWarning">⚠  Please make sure to select the correct download region. Using the wrong region can cause errors during downloads, sync, updates, and all related operations.</sys:String>
